      "classification": null,
      "licenseInfo": "<p>Access: Public.&nbsp;Use: User assumes risk.<br /><br />Disclaimer: This information has been produced using a number of disparate data sources to support assessing and planning activities. It is for assessing and planning purposes only. It is not meant to replace or represent survey-grade boundary data nor to be used for conveyances. Neither the Maine Office of GIS (MEGIS) nor the Maine GeoLibrary are responsible for map errors, omissions, misuse, misinterpretation, or currency of the data. The Maine Office of GIS (MEGIS) and the Maine GeoLibrayr do not edit parcel data for communites and are not responsible for individual parcel data verification.<\/p>",
